  "story": {
    "title": "Whose button is this?",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Tinny Tim was sitting on the road when a button bounced his way.",
      "“I wonder where this comes from,” he said. He wanted to find out.",
      "It was busy on the side of the road. “Woah!” He nearly got squashed.",
      "He made a lucky escape. “It’s scary out here,” he said.",
      "“Hey there, is this yours?”",
      "The green man said nothing. He just turned red. “What a rude person.”",
      "Tinny Tim carried on looking. “Whose button is this?”",
      "“Woah..! ...at least he’s friendly.”",
      "“I’ve got to get to the other side. I’m sure that’s where this comes from.”",
      "SPLASH! “That was close.” He waited for the cars to pass before he carried on.",
      "Maybe this was who he was looking for. “Hello, who are you?”",
      "“I’m Ruby Rags.” “I think this is yours,” he said.",
      "“Thank you, little robot. Can we be friends?”"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Tinny Tim was sitting on the road when a button bounced his way.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tinny Tim đang ngồi trên đường thì một cái cúc áo lăn đến chỗ cậu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I wonder where this comes from,” he said.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Không biết cái này từ đâu ra nhỉ,\" cậu nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He wanted to find out.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu muốn tìm hiểu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was busy on the side of the road.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bên lề đường rất đông đúc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Woah!” He nearly got squashed.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Ối!\" Cậu suýt bị đè bẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He made a lucky escape.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu may mắn thoát được."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“It’s scary out here,” he said.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Ở đây đáng sợ quá,\" cậu nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Hey there, is this yours?”",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Này bạn ơi, cái này của bạn à?\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The green man said nothing.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Người đàn ông xanh lá không nói gì."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He just turned red.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Anh ta chỉ chuyển sang màu đỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“What a rude person.”",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Thật là một người thô lỗ.\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tinny Tim carried on looking.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tinny Tim tiếp tục tìm kiếm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Whose button is this?”",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Cái cúc áo này của ai vậy?\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Woah..! ...at least he’s friendly.”",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ối..! ...ít nhất thì anh ấy cũng thân thiện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I’ve got to get to the other side.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Mình phải sang bên kia."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I’m sure that’s where this comes from.”",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình chắc chắn nó đến từ đó.\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "SPLASH! “That was close.” He waited for the cars to pass before he carried on.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "TÉ NƯỚC! \"Suýt nữa thì...\" Cậu đợi xe cộ đi qua rồi mới tiếp tục."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Maybe this was who he was looking for.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có lẽ đây là người cậu đang tìm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Hello, who are you?”",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Chào bạn, bạn là ai?\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I’m Ruby Rags.” “I think this is yours,” he said.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Mình là Ruby Rags.\" \"Mình nghĩ cái này là của bạn,\" cậu nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Thank you, little robot.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Cảm ơn bạn, người máy nhỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Can we be friends?”",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_104875/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng ta làm bạn nhé?\""
      }
    ]
  },
